/Title (In this research, I will study how processor affinity and workload distribution affect the execution performance of a CPU-bound parallel workload on Linux, using Python \(with the multiprocessing module and os.sched_setaffinity\) and an optional Rust extension for the computation kernel.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 353 0 R
/Prev 518 0 R
/Next 410 0 R
>>
