/Title (Together, these studies suggest that performance depends on both where work runs and how much work each worker receives. Affinity can preserve cache locality and reduce migration, but strict pinning may prevent the operating system from moving work away from a busy core. Load-aware scheduling can improve utilization, yet coordination and queue)
