/Title (H1: Pinning each worker to its own core will give similar or slightly better execution time than the default scheduler, because the scheduler already tends to keep threads on the same core. Pinning all workers to a single core will greatly reduce performance, because the workers will compete for one core.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 525 0 R
