589 0 obj
<<
/Title (I will also check how speedup grows with the number of workers. If speedup stops growing at the number of available cores, extra workers are only competing for the same cores. These explanations will be checked against the actual results. The experiment will not assume that pinning, or more workers, always improves performance.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 528 0 R
/Prev 624 0 R
>>
